{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y的纵向交替在个别短时段不如X左右分栏直观，视线需要上下切换，扫读时稍有负担。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"平\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用高亮短语让人迅速抓住每段的叙事转折，感受又按音乐节点出现，减少了一次性堆在屏幕上的信息负担。它对人物矛盾的解释更具体，从舍不得亲近、害怕孤单，到意识到想念不等于应该回去，前后形成了清楚的心理发展线；感受也有更细的音乐时点和情绪层次。X的左右分栏在扫读上有优势，但右侧感受容易成为一堆缺少时间对应关系的短词，整体不如Y细腻、连贯。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "aee95839-4fdb-43eb-b4a5-8eee0fe08ac1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T195138070714Z", "elapsed_seconds": 81.547, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T19:52:59.627403+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "330444fff94a9745bf9d8ae6bc59753ce1bd0bee767ee7247e094dd3717104cc", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "ee